105
00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:47.907
So it's a 4.1, six, seven mile loop.

106
00:04:47.907 --> 00:04:51.030
And it goes down to the thousandth of a mile.

107
00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:54.050
And even your finishing thing is down to the thousandth

108
00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.610
Every age, yeah.

109
00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:56.443
It's incredible.

110
00:04:56.443 --> 00:04:59.660
And this is wild, because Laz actually dreamed this up

111
00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:01.130
when he was in high school,

112
00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.600
