2218
01:38:13.750 --> 01:38:15.720
So you're going into a different direction,

2219
01:38:15.720 --> 01:38:17.040
every other loop.

2220
01:38:17.040 --> 01:38:20.500
So there's so many components to this race

2221
01:38:20.500 --> 01:38:25.500
