for just a season.

2316
01:42:32.220 --> 01:42:34.333
And like in the winter time, I literally,

2317
01:42:35.260 --> 01:42:36.750
from my January, February,

2318
01:42:36.750 --> 01:42:38.730
I usually like sign up for a gym

2319
01:42:38.730 --> 01:42:41.650
that has a big movie theater

2320
01:42:41.650 --> 01:42:44.392
that you can just run on the treadmill,

2321
01:42:44.392 --> 01:42:47.500
