and yeah, I'll do that in like January, February.

2323
01:42:49.410 --> 01:42:50.760
But the last couple of years,

2324
01:42:50.760 --> 01:42:53.860
I haven't because my races have involved more element

2325
01:42:53.860 --> 01:42:56.520
being out in elements and with Barkley,

2326
01:42:56.520 --> 01:42:58.530
you have to just throw yourself out in that.

2327
01:42:58.530 --> 01:42:59.363
No treadmills.

2328
01:42:59.363 --> 01:43:00.699
No, even-

2329
01:43:00.699 --> 01:43:01.864
Laz would not approve.

2330
01:43:01.864 --> 01:43:03.680
Laz would not approve

2331
01:43:03.680 --> 01:43:08.680
even like being subjected to more cold,

2332
01:43:08.816 --> 01:43:11.360
it's going to be very cold in that race.

2333
01:43:11.360 --> 01:43:13.573
Like when you're up on the ridge line,

2334
01:43:15.160 --> 01:43:17.630
and maybe you're gonna be in the twenties

2335
01:43:17.630 --> 01:43:19.550
or it could be in the thirties,

2336
01:43:19.550 --> 01:43:22.200
this week it's gonna be down, 19.

2337
01:43:22.200 --> 01:43:24.640
So it gets windy.

2338
01:43:24.640 --> 01:43:26.110
When is the race?

2339
01:43:26.110 --> 01:43:29.340
I can't set an exact date, but it is in March.

2340
01:43:29.340 --> 01:43:31.431
Yeah, so it's secreted.

2341
01:43:31.431 --> 01:43:33.020
You know, but you can't say it.

2342
01:43:33.020 --> 01:43:35.510
I know but I'm not allowed to say.

2343
01:43:35.510 --> 01:43:36.763
Right, right, right.

2344
01:43:38.520 --> 01:43:40.800
Why is secrecy around the date?

2345
01:43:40.800 --> 01:43:45.800
Well, right now it is become just an incredible phenomenon

2346
01:43:46.070 --> 01:43:49.510
in terms of like, people are so excited about it.

2347
01:43:49.510 --> 01:43:51.032
So he wants to like-

2348
01:43:51.032 --> 01:43:52.820
Is that part because of the Netflix documentary?

2349
01:43:52.820 --> 01:43:55.993
That's definitely part of it, so it has a huge following.

2350
01:43:57.032 --> 01:43:59.800
I posted about that was in the race,

2351
01:43:59.800 --> 01:44:01.445
which is a little about-

2352
01:44:01.445 --> 01:44:02.906
The condolences?

2353
01:44:02.906 --> 01:44:04.430
Yeah my condolences

2354
01:44:04.430 --> 01:44:07.070
but people knew I was gonna get into it,

2355
01:44:07.070 --> 01:44:09.820
because I have one big backyard.

2356
01:44:09.820 --> 01:44:13.430
And that was one of the benefits of what I want

2357
01:44:13.430 --> 01:44:14.263
from winning Big's,

2358
